# RIA Hub Compliance Statement System Demo

This is a limited public demo of the RIA Hub Compliance Statement System, a local-first workflow tool for investment adviser personal-trading compliance reviews.

The demo is intended to show the product experience, navigation, dashboard layout, and sample compliance workflow using fictional data only.

## What The Demo Shows

- Statement review dashboard
- Access-person and account tracking preview
- Sample statement coverage status
- Sample Restricted List and Watch List alerts
- Compliance alert review flow preview
- Audit log and report screens with demo-only records

## Disabled In The Demo

Production features are intentionally disabled or removed from the public demo, including:

- Real brokerage statement upload
- PDF, CSV, OFX, or QFX parsing
- Original document storage
- Backup and restore of client records
- Production compliance report exports
- Persistent client data workflows
- Commercial parser and review logic

Buttons or screens marked as licensed features are included only to illustrate the full product workflow.

## Commercial Product

The full RIA Hub Compliance Statement System is available under commercial license. The licensed version supports production review cycles, statement intake, trade screening, missing-statement tracking, compliance alert dispositioning, audit logs, exports, and implementation support.

## Important Notice

This demo is not a compliance system of record and does not provide legal, regulatory, or compliance advice. Investment advisers remain responsible for their Code of Ethics, supervisory procedures, books and records obligations, review decisions, and legal/regulatory guidance.

## Contact

For licensing, pilots, or implementation discussions, contact RIA Hub.
